    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1063">

                <pb facs="0916" n="800" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg800"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/15543.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Silliman to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-26T12:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 26, 1915—noon</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Foreign Secretary informed me this morning that Naco had been evacuated by
                    the military after establishing civil authorities; said he was not informed as
                    to the movement on Nogales.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Silliman.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
